        "exact_text": "Generate 5 figures: integral_1.png through integral_4.png (function curve with shaded area and exact value annotation) and error_comparison.png (a grouped bar chart comparing errors of the 3 methods across all 4 integrals on a logarithmic scale). All figures should be publication quality with LaTeX labels.",
        "source_sha256": "0af00699e3d7bb12d30352e0a7ba782c494cdaed8a4a3ba7a839dcb3459573ec",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
